OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas lights trail at city
OL,4,Apark cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Christmas lights event which had been
OL,7,Fexpected to attract more than 70,000
OL,8,Fpeople in Leicester has been cancelled.
OL,10,FNorthern Lights - described as an
OL,11,Fimmersive light trail - was due to take
OL,12,Fplace at Abbey Park from 18 November to
OL,13,F31 December.
OL,15,FOrganisers confirmed to the BBC they
OL,16,Fhad made the "difficult decision" to
OL,17,Fcancel the event as they were "unable
OL,18,Fto sustain the scale and size of the
OL,19,Fevent that we would expect to deliver
OL,20,Ffor our customers".
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
