OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas lights trail at city
OL,4,Apark cancelled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Northern Lights
OL,7,FLeicester said all customers had been
OL,8,Fcontacted and full refunds were being
OL,9,Fprocessed by its ticketing partner.
